# SR10 (SOFT; skipped by the launch config until the thin layer is staged on the runner): the four-card platform replay of the NEW production image: the node agent's serving sequence in a copy of its container running the THIN LAYER on tp4-serve-11 (C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE=local:thin-layer: the
# image name is read by the step from a file the operator writes on the runner before the window and is NEVER committed; the layer is built by the operator on the window image BEFORE the window and pre-pulled by manifest-list digest). The replay sets no profile: it boots the traffic profile BY THE IMAGE DEFAULT. READ the vLLM
# subprocess log from the container (never docker logs): '[QWEN-C2] profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic: vLLM argv', the P150x4 mesh, the extent block, the request-warm line BEFORE the block capture, admission passed with no
# UNQUALIFIED, prefix installed, the Lever N install and warm lines, the prefill warm checks; the :tt alias advertised before and after the restart; NO '[PINDIAG] lever N kill switch' line anywhere in that log (a leftover levern.off would boot with Lever N off while the install and warm lines still print). PASS: 'PLATFORM_REPLAY passed=True'. The replay turns the session cap
# OFF, so the cap is read live after placement. The thinking-budget smoke is NOT run here (the budget path is untouched by Lever N and ran in the ship pack's SR10): add C2_REPLAY_BUDGET_SMOKE=1 and 35 minutes
# if the owner asks. The box runs the replay under an interrupt timeout so its own cleanup removes its container.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the second chained session of 2026-10-08 (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it). ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags
# and every rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11 is the window image (the Lever N traffic profile baked in as its default); tp4-serve-10 is the production base image. C2_BOX_MINUTES is the job's box:
# the workflow enforces it from inside, it never cancels a run. NO profile of this pack carries a digest or an audit (QWEN_PREFIX_DIGESTS, QWEN_PREFIX_AUDIT, the lever audits): test_tp4_session_0808b pins that.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset replay
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE=local:thin-layer
C2_REPLAY_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic
C2_BOX_MINUTES=60
